      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i'm dealing with this hyperthyroidism thing and it's making my adderall feel way too intense. my heart gets like super jumpy and i feel like i'm vibrating lol. i don't want to go back to the doctor every time i feel a bit shaky, so is it a good idea to just break my adderall into tiny little pieces and take them every hour or two throughout the day? like, would spreading it out that way help keep my heart rate from spiking so much?",
